You bind light in a glyph on the floor. All enemies walking over the glyph will be dazed for [4, 5, 6, 7, 8 (TL1-5)] turns.

The glyph is a hidden trap ([26, 37, 46, 53, 60 (TL1-5; MAG 100)] detection and [33, 47, 58, 67, 75 (TL1-5; MAG 100)] disarm power based on your Magic) and lasts for [6, 7, 8, 9, 10 (TL1-5)] turns.
